{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117373","id":3390422860,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KFb9M","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117373","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117373.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117373.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117373","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117373/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117373/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117373/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/106bbaa2e89ff47a43edd86b950873db909870ac","number":117373,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix undoing terrain set move duplicates terrain in second set","user":{"login":"filipemrabreu","id":134237365,"node_id":"U_kgDOCABMtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134237365?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu","html_url":"https://github.com/filipemrabreu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filipemrabreu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: #116636 \r\n\r\n## Bug Preview\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b831ab7-a54d-4aeb-95d6-5b948c5990c2\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\n\r\nThe issue was caused by the undo system restoring terrain properties without clearing the existing terrain container first. Because of this, the previous terrain state was effectively applied on top of the current one, leading to duplicated or mismatched terrain data.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the problem by clearing the terrains in the affected terrain sets before restoring their properties during undo. This ensures the terrain containers are rebuilt from the saved undo state instead of being merged with the current state.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3c86048-a57b-47e3-be3d-8d36ebdea7c4","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mg